    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Isaiah 40:28 — “The Lord is the everlasting God, the Creator of the ends of the earth.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Colossians 1:16 — “For by him were all things created, that are in heaven, and that are in earth.”",
    "GREEK": "κτίστης",
